Buy your discount!
Nanking real estate market re-pays dividends in yuan - China's new network
In an interview with the Yangon Evening News/Purple News Journalist, Yangon Evening News/Purple News reported that the ten-year-old bond agreement has returned to the Nanking housing market, where a block of flats in Jiangsu's New District claims that the difference in price is greater than the previous discount, and developers are willing to exchange and refund the difference in price for home buyers.
There are a lot of conditions in the price-guarantee agreement.
The building, which is located in Jiangxi's New District, is known as the Puliyan Yuzhou Cloud Tower, and the owner of the building, Mr. Sun, told reporters that he found a brick-and-mortar declaration of brick-and-mortar when he rented the building last weekend.
The photographs he sent to reporters show that the developer's pledge that if the property was purchased between February 1 and February 28 from the date of the purchase and sale contract between the two parties until the delivery of the corresponding source of housing, the developer can change the house for the buyer and refund the difference if the discount on other homes in the project is greater than the discount on the previous purchase of the house (the limit is the same as the house, the same building block, the same unit, other unsold commodity houses of the same property type), the developer can change the house for the buyer and refund the difference.
Mr. Sun said that the real estate consultant said that it was actually a loan agreement, aimed at giving buyers confidence to get started, without worrying about developing enterprises to promote lower prices.
Many home buyers believe that the terms of the bond agreement are not low, even if the buyer is willing to buy the house.
A Chinese woman who is planning to buy a new house in Jiangxi said that the price of the house should first be the same type of house, it should be in the same building, the same unit, and the buyer can compare the price of the house, so the threshold is quite high.
Some buyers also believe that due to the asymmetry of the information, the sale does not exclude the giving of additional concessions, and the difficulty of acquiring the rights of the buyer is not small.
Whether buyers can keep their homes for observation
Reporters inquired about real estate in Nanjing online and learned that the property was sold in November last year for a total of 252 apartment blocks with 105 square meters, 114 square meters, 129 square meters, and a total renovation sale of 39843 yuan/m2.
However, more than two months ago, online real estate showed that the total number of unsold suites in the building currently stands at 157, representing 62.3%, of which the 8th floor has a total of 128 suites, the number of unsold suites reaches 113, and the 7th floor has 44 unsold suites, representing only 13% of the total number of suites in the project.
According to marketers, in 2008 there was also an agreement on the price of lithium-ion batteries in Nanjing.
In August of that year, in order to attract the attention of home buyers, the floors on the Huang Huang Mountain Road in Yokohama, South Korea, launched a coupon plan, specifically promising that the company would reimburse the old homeowners the difference if the range of the offer expanded within a year.
Since then, in April 2011, nine properties in Nanjing have also taken out some of the housing promises to compensate for the difference in prices.
As the housing market warms up, more acupuncture is needed.
Mr. Shen, a senior operator in the Nanjing real estate industry, said that the PPP is also one of the marketing methods for real estate companies.
He believes that today's development companies need more confidence than home buyers, and the introduction of the PPP is actually giving them a boost.
As to whether to retain buyers, he said it depends on the influence of multiple factors such as regulatory policies, loan thresholds, and so on.
Chinese rescue team continues rescue operations in Turkey to rescue four trapped people - China New Network
According to the website of the Ministry of Emergency Management, on February 10, the Chinese rescue team, which is searching and rescuing Turkey, sent three operational units, 45 rescue personnel, and rescued one trapped person.
At the same time, two search and evaluation teams were dispatched to evaluate and search 15 blocks of buildings on Vadhabhash Street.
So far, a total of four people have been rescued, five people have been identified, and life signs and risk assessments have been carried out on 25 buildings that collapsed severely.
Rescue teams will continue to carry out in-depth rescue work based on the actual situation in the disaster area and on the rescue site, scientifically adjusting the rescue force.
Rescue teams access information through various channels such as embassies, local governments, United Nations relief organizations, and verify information through online inquiries and on-site searches.
The Chinese Hong Kong Rescue Team was briefed on the current situation of the rescue environment and the collapse of buildings and a joint search operation.
The SSC5 is currently responsible for regional coordination with the Italian Rescue Team, while sending three teams to work in the Regional Rescue Coordination Centre No. 5, to communicate with teams from Italy, the United Kingdom, Serbia, Slovakia, and Oman, and to learn about the work of the United Nations Rescue Organization and the rescue teams of the countries.
Rescue teams continue to strengthen the security management and security of the squad, in accordance with the principle of uniform command, safety first, strengthening the security control in the rescue site, strengthening the disciplinary requirements of the rescue work, and clarifying safety precautions.
Continued operation of the rotational reserve and standby work system, strengthening the security management of the camp.
Rescue team medical personnel provide medical services to the team members every day, strengthen the medical security of key personnel, and currently rescue team members are in good health and carry out extermination in the camp.
After the establishment of the camp, the logistics security team built 26 field tents of four types, including command communications, equipment storage, medical cleaning, living accommodation and dog shelter, ensuring more than 30 sets of on-site rescue equipment.
Kim Jong-un's father and daughter interacted intimately and his wife froze to death.
The 75th anniversary parade was held in North Korea on the evening of the 8th, and Kim Jong-un's daughter, Kim Jong-il, not only attended, but also stood on the chair with her father.
The official Korean media released a video on 9 November showing Ms. Kim standing next to her father, holding hands, holding her father's cheek, even touching his chest, and interacting pictures of her father and daughter being broadcast across the country.
However, First Lady Lee Syeong can only step aside.
In an official photo of Kim Jong-un and Lee She-sung attending dinner with their daughter Kim Jong-il on the 7th, Kim Jong-il not only rarely sits in the middle of her parents' C-seat, she also ascends the chair with Kim Jong-il at the 75th anniversary parade ceremony the following evening.
North Korean state media released a video of the parade after the incident, exposing more images of fathers and daughters in love.
Kim Jong-un looked at his daughter several times on the chair, the smiles on their faces never receded, and they were talking in each other's ears.
Other official media footage also showed Lady Gaga touching her father's face with her hands while sitting on Kim Jong-un's couch in the living room; she touched Kim Jong-un's chest with her hands as she walked with him.
First Lady Li Shui, who can only walk in the back or sit on her side, is always a few steps away from her husband and daughter.
According to South Korean media, Kim Jong-il's chances of being exposed for the first time in three months have increased since the launch of Mars 17 on November 18 last year, and this is the fifth time it has appeared on official occasions.
The official media in North Korea used high-level titles such as the most beloved son, the noble son, when referring to Kim Jong-il, and also broadcasted a clip of Kim Jong-il repeatedly shouting his death in support of white bloodlines as he watched the parade on the stage.
These signs have led the outside world to doubt whether Kim Jong-il has been identified as the heir to the Kim regime, with the Washington Post analyzing that Kim Jong-il is the signal that Kim Jong-il is pushing his middle-school-aged daughter to the position of successor, but there is also the view that such a judgment is still premature and that it still holds various possibilities in the case of Kim Jong-il having a son under his knee.
Securities and Exchange Commission authorization to develop all funds on behalf of investors to collect and query - Economic Watch Network - Professional financial news website
Economic Observation Network: Journalist Chen Zhen found it difficult to collect account information because of the difficulty of buying channels.
Do you always forget to pick up the gold deposit box?
These problems of the indigenous people will soon be solved.
On 10 February, the Securities and Exchange Commission announced that the Apple Fund's E-account app had been rolled out to mobile app stores and was being publicly tested.
According to the report, Liquidation Fund E account Liquidation is a one-stop Liquidation Query service that provides individual investors with public fund accounts and share information, aimed at addressing the pain points of services such as Large, Small and Medium Investor Forgetting Accounts and Liquidation Queries.
According to Wind data, as of the end of 2022, there were 156 public fund managers in the country, with a management fund size of about 26 trillion yuan; 167 public fund share registration institutions and 411 public fund sales institutions.
The accounting systems of the participating entities are independent of each other and lack an industry-wide unified query channel.
According to industry figures, by the end of 2021, more than 720 million fund investors in China, or half of the country, had invested in fund products.
Previously, investors were required to inquire about purchases through different sales agencies, while through the Ethereum Fund E account, investors were able to inquire about purchases through all sales channels.
What is an E-Accounting App?
According to the relevant documents, Liu Fund E account Liu APP is a mobile application for the public-sector fund industry that has been approved by the Chinese Securities and Exchange Commission for development and construction in China and provides investors with one-stop inquiries about the holding of out-of-market shares in public-sector fund products throughout the market.
Investors can easily and quickly gain control of their holdings in the open market fund product market of fund managers purchased through sales channels across the market, improving the overall efficiency of inquiries.
Specifically, the information that investors can access through the E-Fund account tabs includes: information on fund accounts opened by fund managers across the market, information on transaction accounts opened by public fund sales agencies, and the number of investors who hold out-of-the-box holdings of products such as collective asset management schemes limited to 200 persons, including publicly funded securities investment funds and those managed by securities firms.
Shanghai Securities Fund Research Center's head of business, Liu Yi, told Economic Observer that investors can find out about all their out-of-the-box fund holdings through the Liquid Fund E-Account Liquidation App, helping them find their way back to the forgotten asset classes, and more importantly, helping clients to integrate full account information about the overall fund investment situation, helping clients gain more timely, accurate and complete control over their own investments, thus better optimizing their own fund portfolio configuration and better planning their own financial arrangements.
How to register for use?
The reporter noted that at the moment, the Apple Fund E account Apple App is already available in mobile app stores such as Huawei, Apple, Xiaomi, OPPO, Vivo, but the app is still in the open trial phase, registration requires filling out an invitation form and investors can contact the fund manager who holds the fund to obtain it.
A client of a large public fund in Shanghai provided a six-digit invitation to Economy Observer and told reporters that during the pilot phase of the APP, China will provide a certain number of invitations to each fund manager, and investors will receive calls, and we will provide them.
After the end of the trial run, no invitation code is needed to open user registration.
Oh, my God.
According to the official website of the Supervisory Board, the journalist downloaded and used the documentation to register the account and completed the inquiry, which took only a few minutes and was mainly divided into four steps: user registration, identity verification, fund account binding, public procurement fund inquiry.
After this step of authenticating by name, clicking on the bonding button allows journalists to see the total assets of the fund and start using the query function.
It is worth noting that the Bank's E-Account Bank provides inquiry services only to investors and cannot make a redemption sale.
The data displayed in the E Fund Account Kitchen is generally the date on which users are asked questions (T-Day) three trading days ahead.
For example, if you open an Asset Fund E account on February 10th, the total assets, fund shares, and net worth corresponding to the Asset Page will be pushed back three trading days to that date, which is February 7th.
