He said that in order to learn more about implementing the spirit of the keynote address delivered by Xi Jinping's Secretary-General at the opening of the workshops, to be stronger in upholding the two established tenets, to be stronger in upholding the two tenets, to strengthen leadership, to hold firmly, to firmly promote Chinese-style modernization efforts, to fully build a socialist modern state, and to fully promote the great revival of the Chinese people.
